I think that's what it is. Anyway, so this is the setting in which Margaret Thatcher emerges. She became Tory leader in the year she turned 50. So before we get into how she became Tory leader, we'll look at the previous 50 years. She was born, Tom, you know, of course, where she was born. She was born in Grantham in Lincolnshire. I do. In October 1925.
